This store implements the [Universal Commerce Protocol](https://ucp.dev).

- **Discovery** — `GET https://venustas.com/.well-known/ucp`
- **MCP endpoint** — `POST https://venustas.com/api/ucp/mcp` with `Content-Type: application/json`

